WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.142 --> 00:00:10.144
Welcome. CropHealth EWS forecasts Late Blight and Early Blight in Musanze, Rwanda, and warns farmers by SMS in Kinyarwanda.

2
00:00:10.144 --> 00:00:19.107
Step 1: sign in with the demo account (admin / crophealth2026).

3
00:00:19.107 --> 00:00:30.107
Risk Simulator: micro-climate readings produce a risk probability for each disease, with a tier and a recommended action.

4
00:00:30.107 --> 00:00:41.136
Preset 1, Rwaza marshland mist: cool, wet, and foggy. Late Blight reaches EMERGENCY and the advice is a systemic fungicide.

5
00:00:41.136 --> 00:00:55.391
Sweeping relative humidity down, then back up. While the leaf stays wet, Late Blight risk remains high, so leaf wetness matters as much as humidity.

6
00:00:55.391 --> 00:01:07.932
Foliar leaf wetness is the strongest driver in the model. With no water film on the leaf, infection cannot start.

7
00:01:07.932 --> 00:01:19.653
Temperature sweep from 16 to 27 degrees. Late Blight favours the 18 degree optimum; Early Blight rises as the air warms.

8
00:01:19.653 --> 00:01:29.666
Dispatch: the Kinyarwanda advisory is sent to the farmer’s feature phone through the SMS gateway, and the console confirms delivery.

9
00:01:29.666 --> 00:01:40.678
Preset 2, Nkotsi warm and wet hillside: Late Blight is still EMERGENCY, and Early Blight rises to MODERATE.

10
00:01:40.678 --> 00:01:51.692
Preset 3, sunny afternoon: both risks fall to SAFE. The advice is to skip spraying, which saves money and protects the soil.

11
00:01:51.692 --> 00:01:57.725
Telemetry and NISR Data: 48 hours of field readings for each sector, checked against the 85% humidity and 18 degree thresholds.

12
00:01:57.725 --> 00:02:04.775
Switching to Nkotsi hillside to compare the same thresholds on a different site.

13
00:02:04.775 --> 00:02:17.303
NISR SAS 2026 Season A: most Musanze farmers already spray chemicals, so targeted warnings can cut unnecessary applications.

14
00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:32.344
Feature importance shows which measured conditions the model relies on most.

15
00:02:32.344 --> 00:02:43.382
Back to the simulator, then secure sign-out returns to the login page. Thank you.
